  "description": "Structural study of KHM A297: elongated stepped flanges partitioned by a transverse band, an open crenellated crown, a twisted beveled iron haft and two supported cord windings over a wood grip.",
  "notes": {
    "source": "https://www.khm.at/kunstwerke/streitkolben-372692",
    "images": [
      "https://www.khm.at/pics/372692/HJRK_A_297_202303_1.jpg"
    ],
    "rights": "Kunsthistorisches Museum, Hofjagd- und Ruestkammer. Museum photograph used as private local reference; not redistributed in the repository.",
    "published": {
