      "haftLengthMetres": 0.208,
      "haftMaximumBreadthMetres": 0.018,
      "bandOuterDiameterMetres": 0.032
    },
    "assumptions": [
      "Six equivalent flanges and four crown teeth are reconstruction hypotheses from one photographed pose, not published counts. Unseen reverse faces are not independently established.",
      "Solid steel substitutes for iron of unknown internal construction. Core radii, 2 mm flange thickness and 2.5 mm crown wall are unmeasured. Density and thickness were not adjusted to fit the reported mass.",
      "The beveled 16 by 16 mm haft section and its 650 degree left twist reproduce the visible helical envelope; hidden section geometry is unknown.",
      "Cord is modeled as compressed material with flat undersides and finite crests. Thickness, crest fractions, hidden wood and contacts are construction assumptions; no hidden sleeve supports the coarse binding.",
      "The transverse band occupies its own axial interval; same-material central continuity is assumed and no flange material is counted inside it."
    ],
    "scope": "Complete visible structural silhouette, stepped flange bodies, transverse band, open crown, twisted haft, guard and butt discs, dense cord and coarse binding, wood grip and butt loop. Fine chasing, engraved rope ticks, fibres, wear and patina are excluded.",
    "coverage": {
      "browser": "gothic-flanged-mace",
      "gameplay": [],
      "relatedStudy": "cma-1916-1589"
    }
  }
